      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Lars-G\xF6ran is a 48-year-old veteran from Dalarna, Sweden. He was
        a tank commander during the war, which he bears heavy scars from.\n\nSpecial
        effects:\nRemembers self-help messages on low speed."
