      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Carla Cap\xF4 is a 28-year-old streamer from Faro, Portugal. She is
        a charismatic individual with a bubbly personality. She usually brings her
        streams with her into the tank while racing. \n\nSpecial effects:\nHas a
        Shudder chat. "
