    - target: {fileID: 3659062856983726037, guid: f00f41a79433ed04280b944953b51b56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "The 36-year-old Tristano Martinelli from Tivoli, Italy, has loved performance
        and theatre ever since he was a young boy. He took the role as the Harlequin
        in commedia dell\u2019arte before the war, when he got drafted as a tank
        driver and continues his performing career today. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
