      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Andr\xE9 Nuskea, also called Drago\u0219 (by himself), was born in Tulcea,
    Romania. Andr\xE9 was thrown out from home after not achieving anything but managed
    to get back on his feet by winning a huge amount of money from a lottery ticket.
    Now, he continues his life as a 25-year-old tank rally racer."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
