  m_text: "Carla Cap\xF4 is a 28-year-old streamer from Faro, Portugal. She is a
    charismatic individual with a bubbly personality and usually brings her stream
    into the tank while racing.\r\n\r\nSpecial effects:\r\nHas a Shudder chat. "
