  m_text: "The 36-year-old Tristano Martinelli from Tivoli, Italy, has loved performance
    and theatre ever since he was a young boy. He took the role as the Harlequin
    in commedia dell\u2019arte before the war, when he got drafted as a tank driver
    and continues his performing career today. "
